<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 21.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 21.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 21		July 18</p>
<p>Fed acct			 6.027		  5.156</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  22.050		 20.150</p>
<p>Cash balance		  28.077		 25.306</p>
<p>	  ---</p>
<p>Total public debt,  subject to limit	5,278.227	     5,277.382</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $8 million were issued and $157 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
